; Input window cursor state
;
; Column counter ($85B3), cursor screen address ($85B4), and the cursor's
; glyph ($85B6: '+', set at $6C85). Set at the start ($6C82) and by the print
; routine #R$85B8.
@label=InputColumn
g$85B3 DEFB $00
@label=InputCursor
 $85B4 DEFW $0000
@label=InputCursorGlyph
 $85B6 DEFB $00
